  "question": "设数列 $a_{n} = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{ll} 1, & n \\leqslant k \\\\ \\frac{(n + 1)^{k} - n^{k}}{C_{n}^{k - 1}}, & n > k \\end{array} \\right.$ （ $k \\in \\mathbb{N}_{+}$ ）．若 $b_{n} = 1 + \\sum_{k=1}^{n} (k \\lim_{n \\to \\infty} a_{n})$ ，求 $\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} \\left( \\frac{b_{n}^{2}}{b_{n-1} b_{n+1}} \\right)^{n}$ .",
  "answer": "\\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\left(\\frac {b _ {n} ^ {2}}{b _ {n - 1} b _ {n + 1}}\\right) ^ {n} = \\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\left(\\frac {n}{n + 1}\\right) ^ {n} = e ^ {- 1}.",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "极限计算"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 计算 $\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}a_n$ 时显然要先将 $a_{n} = \\frac{(n + 1)^{k} - n^{k}}{C_{n}^{k - 1}}$ 进行初等运算化简；然后要将 $b_{n}$ 的表达式化简才便于计算所求极限."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "由于"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "\\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} a _ {n} = \\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac {(n + 1) ^ {k} - n ^ {k}}{C _ {n} ^ {k - 1}} = \\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac {(k - 1) ! \\left[ k n ^ {k - 1} + \\frac {(k - 1) k}{2 !} n ^ {k - 2} + \\cdots + 1 \\right]}{n (n - 1) \\cdots (n - k + 1)} = k!.\\tag{①}"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "故"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "b _ {n} = 1 + \\sum_ {k = 1} ^ {n} (k \\cdot k!) = (n + 1)! (\\text {归纳法易证}).\\tag{②}"
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "所以"
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "text": "\\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\left(\\frac {b _ {n} ^ {2}}{b _ {n - 1} b _ {n + 1}}\\right) ^ {n} = \\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\left(\\frac {n}{n + 1}\\right) ^ {n} = e ^ {- 1}."
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "\\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\left(\\frac {b _ {n} ^ {2}}{b _ {n - 1} b _ {n + 1}}\\right) ^ {n} = \\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\left(\\frac {n}{n + 1}\\right) ^ {n} = e ^ {- 1}.",
